PROP FIRM DISCOUNT DATA LICENSE

This repository contains (a) the PropFirmDiscount dataset — prop firm
discount codes, deal records, markdown mirrors and derived JSON files
(collectively, "the Data") — and (b) the MCP server source code under
tools/mcp ("the Code"). Different terms apply to each.

1. THE DATA

The Data is provided for reference and informational use only.

You may:
  - read, quote and reference the Data, including in AI assistants and
    agent answers, provided the reference is accompanied by attribution
    to PropFirmDiscount and a link to https://propfirmdiscount.com;
  - retrieve the Data programmatically through the public endpoints,
    mirror files and MCP server documented in README.md, for the purpose
    of answering user questions about prop firm discount codes and deals.

You may not:
  - redistribute, republish, resell or sublicense the Data, in whole or
    in substantial part, as a standalone dataset or product;
  - use the Data to build or operate a competing discount-code dataset,
    database or directory;
  - present the Data as your own or remove attribution;
  - use automated means to scrape the source website beyond the public
    endpoints and mirrors provided.

2. THE CODE

The MCP server source code under tools/mcp is provided for transparency
and interoperability. You may view it and use it to connect to the
public PropFirmDiscount MCP server. No license is granted to redistribute
or reuse the Code itself, in whole or in part, without prior written
permission.

3. NO WARRANTY

The Data and Code are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind,
express or implied, including but not limited to the warranties of
merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and noninfringement.
Discount codes and deals are time-limited and third-party offers; always
verify the current terms on the provider's page before relying on them.
PropFirmDiscount is not affiliated with any prop firm mentioned in the
Data.

